  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{秘密|ひみつ}→秘密：02504_himitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{暴露|ばくろ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - to expose a secret\n- ⟦{真実|しんじつ}→真実：05316_shinjitsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{暴露|ばくろ}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ - to reveal the truth\n- {暴露|ばくろ}{本|ぼん} - tell-all book, exposé\n- {暴露|ばくろ}⟦{記事|きじ}→記事：00227_kiji⟧ - exposé article\n\nUSAGE:\nOften implies sensational or scandalous revelation. Used frequently in media and tabloid contexts.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{発覚|はっかく}→発覚：07629_hakkaku⟧ - coming to light (passive discovery)\n- ⟦{隠蔽|いんぺい}→隠蔽：07627_inpei⟧ - concealment (opposite action)\n- ⟦{告発|こくはつ}→告発：07999_kokuhatsu⟧ - accusation, disclosure (formal/legal)",
